+
+// calculateHardQuotaCooldown backs off an exhausted quota harder than a
+// transient failure but far less than a billing failure.
+//
+//	1 error  → 15 minutes
+//	2 errors → 30 minutes
+//	3 errors → 1 hour
+//	4+       → 2 hours (cap)
+//
